## Tailored Gap Analysis & Implementation Action Plan

### 1. dOSPO Gap Analysis
*If dOSPO score < 18*: Authorize a time-limited dOSPO Charter (`dOSPO/dOSPO Charter`) and establish clear Policy Engine rules.

### 2. OMF Gap Analysis
*If OMF score < 18*: Transition grant spending into 12-month Maintainer Retainer Charters (`OMF/Program Charter Template`) and deploy Open Source Observer (OSO) metrics.

### 3. ORF Gap Analysis
*If ORF score < 18*: Launch Enterprise Maintenance SLAs (`ORF/Enterprise SLA & Reciprocal Funding Agreement`) and enact an Investment Policy Statement (`ORF/Investment Policy Statement Template`).
